*.bak
*~

# The repo-root .gitignore (line ~50) has a bare `core` rule (core-dump pattern)
# that swallows ANY directory named `core` — including wiki source dirs such as
# src/isa/core/. Defensively un-ignore the ENTIRE wiki source tree so no parent
# bare-name rule (core, tmp, build, …) can ever drop a wiki page again.
!src/
!src/**/
!src/**
